          "line_end": 571,
          "line_start": 571,
          "path": "docs/plans/monkeydesign-design-workflow.md",
          "repository": "chaitin/monkeycode",
          "url": "https://github.com/chaitin/MonkeyCode/blob/a67aef068778d4be596ca1cf793f7be25c408a26/docs/plans/monkeydesign-design-workflow.md#L571-L571"
        },
        {
          "commit": "a67aef068778d4be596ca1cf793f7be25c408a26",
          "git_sha": "e1eeebe55d140f5dee7a6d785386aae858d8dfe4",
          "line_end": 583,
          "line_start": 575,
          "path": "docs/plans/monkeydesign-design-workflow.md",
          "repository": "chaitin/monkeycode",
          "url": "https://github.com/chaitin/MonkeyCode/blob/a67aef068778d4be596ca1cf793f7be25c408a26/docs/plans/monkeydesign-design-workflow.md#L575-L583"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_813f1ec4f1d45c2cabffe80ec2448b08e420c967e5a9568e17250c6c84101c48",
        "slc_de8fa0de060f78d7c25891adf12874ee24ae11c1d63123f445e82f822f3c0faa"
      ],
      "text": "The plan proposes new agent-client protocol messages (design/start-choice, template/reference/pattern selection, redesign-level) because plain AskUserQuestion cannot carry images; these appear to be proposals, not shipped behavior."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_16217d9acbcbc15cb19c14496e29cddb8589dab2e0b9ebd5a2823bc10ea93135",
